      "level": 2,
      "content": "12.DISGUISED UNEMPLOYMENT"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dvjc7fv"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Competitive exams frequently test the distinction between GDP contribution and employment share across economic sectors in India.",
        "Disguised unemployment features marginal productivity of labor equal to zero and is heavily tested in agriculture-based economics questions.",
        "Differences between Public (welfare-oriented) and Private (profit-oriented) sectors as well as Organised vs. Unorganised labor laws are regular exam topics."
      ],
      "id": "zsrgmou"
